{"id":41755,"title":"114 | 常用服务发现组件比较","content":"本文对比分析了主流服务发现组件 Eureka、Consul、ZooKeeper 和 ETCD 的核心差异，为架构选型提供依据。在健康检查方面，Eureka 与 Consul 支持灵活的心跳及脚本定制，而 ZooKeeper 和 ETCD 主要依赖连接心跳。多数据中心支持上，Eureka 原生具备跨机房能力，Consul 亦支持分布式部署，ZooKeeper 与 ETCD 官方则主要局限于单数据中心。功能扩展性上，Consul、ZooKeeper 和 ETCD 均支持 KV 存储以兼顾动态配置，Eureka 则专注服务发现。一致性协议与 CAP 模型是核心分水岭：Eureka 采用自研 P2P 协议，属 AP 系统，保证高可用与最终一致性；Consul 基于 Raft 协议，偏向 CA；ZooKeeper 和 ETCD 基于 Paxos 或 Raft，属 CP 系统，强一致但牺牲部分可用性。客户端交互上，Consul 独特支持 DNS 查询，ZooKeeper 擅长 Watch 实时通知，ETCD 支持 gRPC，Eureka 则以 HTTP 增量拉取为主。安全层面，Consul 提供完善的 ACL 与 HTTPS 支持，Eureka 需借助 Spring Cloud 扩展基础认证。当前社区中，Eureka 因 Netflix 背景及 Spring Cloud 深度集成流行度最高，Consul 凭借跨数据中心、KV 存储及 DNS 等亮点成为强力替代方案；ZooKeeper 因通用性强但场景过重，ETCD 虽新但在服务发现领域普及度稍逊，二者通常非首选。架构师应结合业务对一致性、可用性及运维复杂度的具体需求进行权衡。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":36604,"user_name":"杨波","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1030344,"ip_address":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","comment_is_top":true,"comment_ctime":1541170058,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":13174,"content":"这个是作者勘误","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1541423329,"ip_address":"","comment_id":36604,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"作者提示注意：视频ppt表格中有一处错误，根据Consul官方站点描述，Consul是一种CP系统，不是CA系统，参考：https:&#47;&#47;www.consul.io&#47;intro&#47;vs&#47;serf.html\nIn CAP terms, Consul uses a CP architecture, favoring consistency over availability.","like_count":7,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":427933,"discussion_content":"这个是作者勘误","content_length":7,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_